# Trivy vulnerability suppressions for `yarn security:deps` (scripts/deps-scan.cjs).
#
# Only add an entry when a HIGH/CRITICAL finding is a confirmed false positive or
# an explicitly accepted risk (for example: no upstream fix yet, or the vulnerable
# code path is unreachable in this Electron desktop app). Record why, and prefer
# upgrading the dependency over suppressing.
#
# Format: one CVE / advisory ID per line. Optional expiry keeps suppressions honest.
#   CVE-2024-12345
#   CVE-2024-12345 exp:2026-12-31
#
# Keep this file empty unless a suppression is genuinely justified.
